  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "For an **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN** [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction), a unit with Thrill Seekers can still charge and shoot in the same turn that it [Advances](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) or [Falls Back](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back). If it does so, leave out enemies that were in its [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) when the turn began. Its shooting and charges also have to avoid targets chosen for an attack or charge by another unit in that same phase.",
